+# Spec: JSON Merge Patch
+
+Standard: RFC 7396 section 2 (request cited RFC 7386, which RFC 7396 obsoletes; same algorithm).
+`applyMergePatch(target, patch)` exported from `src/index.ts`; pure, returns new value, no shared structure,
+`__proto__` handled as a plain member. Tests: `tests/merge-patch.test.ts` (Appendix A examples and edge cases).
